// expect: 5
// Severance tells the truth — `allocates` (Alloc live in its row)
// is never offered "Real-time safe (proven zero allocation)"; `quiet`
// (a Pure body) still earns the full severance set. The reached set
// reads the CHASED row, the same resolution the row render walks.
fn allocates() = len(make_list(3))

fn quiet(x) = x + 1

fn main() = allocates() + quiet(1)
